(2300612, 318968, 41337, '<td valign="top">While the motion blur conveys the jump nicely it doesn''t work here (IMO) because too little is in the shot. Perhaps if the whole frog was captured and the legs had the motion blur it would have been a great shot or what you have here but with the legs in focus. Great idea.</td>', 'While the motion blur conveys the jump nicely it doesn''t work here (IMO) because too little is in the shot. Perhaps if the whole frog was captured and the legs had the motion blur it would have been a great shot or what you have here but with the legs in focus. Great idea.', '2006-04-10 01:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
