(2300712, 318898, 27562, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  One suggestion to better isolate your subject would be to dial in -1.0 to the ambient exposure and use fill flash to properly light your subject. It would also make the shadows less problematic like the distracting shadow on the soon to be in pain subject''s face. Good work, 6.</td>', 'Great perspective.  One suggestion to better isolate your subject would be to dial in -1.0 to the ambient exposure and use fill flash to properly light your subject. It would also make the shadows less problematic like the distracting shadow on the soon to be in pain subject''s face. Good work, 6.', '2006-04-10 02:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
