(2300719, 318789, 27562, '<td valign="top">IT''S A BOy!  Sorry, I couldn''t help it.  Nice capture. Background is slightly blown and somewhat distracting, but I understand that your perspectives were probably limited. Good work.</td>', 'IT''S A BOy!  Sorry, I couldn''t help it.  Nice capture. Background is slightly blown and somewhat distracting, but I understand that your perspectives were probably limited. Good work.', '2006-04-10 02:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
