(2303792, 318661, 42100, '<td valign="top">Masterful composition, thumbnail preview had me thinking this was going to be a collage.  I like your choice of the sepia like treatment.  Motocross usually has you thinking bright colors, but this really works.  My top pick of the challenge, good luck!</td>', 'Masterful composition, thumbnail preview had me thinking this was going to be a collage.  I like your choice of the sepia like treatment.  Motocross usually has you thinking bright colors, but this really works.  My top pick of the challenge, good luck!', '2006-04-11 15:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
