(2308802, 317456, 57151, '<td valign="top">The lack of an obvious launching point fot the figure creates great tension!  It''s hard to say what''s happening to this guy... is he jumping up, coming down, or being blasted by an angry and vengeful God for some terrible misdeed?  I do seem to see some awkward transitioning between the color and b/w areas, especially around the hands, though it''s hard to tell at this resolution.  Overall, I like it a lot.</td>', 'The lack of an obvious launching point fot the figure creates great tension!  It''s hard to say what''s happening to this guy... is he jumping up, coming down, or being blasted by an angry and vengeful God for some terrible misdeed?  I do seem to see some awkward transitioning between the color and b/w areas, especially around the hands, though it''s hard to tell at this resolution.  Overall, I like it a lot.', '2006-04-12 23:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
