(2314175, 316362, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I wonder how many attempts this took. Nice comp and tones.  One of my highest scorers.</td>', 'Great capture! I wonder how many attempts this took. Nice comp and tones.  One of my highest scorers.', '2006-04-15 12:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
