(2314258, 315867, 44754, '<td valign="top">as much as I love BW photos, this seems like it would have been better in color. just sayn''. everything just seems to blend together.</td>', 'as much as I love BW photos, this seems like it would have been better in color. just sayn''. everything just seems to blend together.', '2006-04-15 13:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
