(2314266, 318231, 44754, '<td valign="top">cool shot. did you just desat everything but red?</td>', 'cool shot. did you just desat everything but red?', '2006-04-15 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314268, 318771, 44754, '<td valign="top">a little bit tighter crop. out of focus</td>', 'a little bit tighter crop. out of focus', '2006-04-15 13:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314318, 318830, 45019, '<td valign="top">this is so cute, love the orange jacket with the washed out other colors</td>', 'this is so cute, love the orange jacket with the washed out other colors', '2006-04-15 14:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314373, 318176, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the old feeling your image conveys because of the vignetting and contrast. 8.</td>', 'I like the old feeling your image conveys because of the vignetting and contrast. 8.', '2006-04-15 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314376, 318790, 27845, '<td valign="top">The moment is captured quite well, but the composition should be less static. The leading lines go past your point of interest. 6.</td>', 'The moment is captured quite well, but the composition should be less static. The leading lines go past your point of interest. 6.', '2006-04-15 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314382, 318620, 27845, '<td valign="top">Quite a surreal image. The colours and softness work well, the model is lacking contrast though. Maybe an off-center composition would have added some dynamism and movement. 7.</td>', 'Quite a surreal image. The colours and softness work well, the model is lacking contrast though. Maybe an off-center composition would have added some dynamism and movement. 7.', '2006-04-15 15:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314384, 318563, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your subject is not very interesting. The Woodies are hard to handle in photography, if you use them you should make sure that it results in something unusual and unexpected. On the technical side, your subject is lit too flatly and casts distracting shadows on the background. (You can prevent this by moving the background further back.) The picture might also profit from a stronger contrast, it would add to the nice textures in the wood. 3.</td>', 'Your subject is not very interesting. The Woodies are hard to handle in photography, if you use them you should make sure that it results in something unusual and unexpected. On the technical side, your subject is lit too flatly and casts distracting shadows on the background. (You can prevent this by moving the background further back.) The picture might also profit from a stronger contrast, it would add to the nice textures in the wood. 3.', '2006-04-15 15:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314386, 317420, 27845, '<td valign="top">The scene is quite funny. Your image is too busy though, the turtles and the heron are lost amidst the many branches and reflections of the surrounding fauna.<br/>Whilst borders are a matter of taste, you should make sure it''s symmetric - yours looks as if it had been painted by hand. 3.</td>', 'The scene is quite funny. Your image is too busy though, the turtles and the heron are lost amidst the many branches and reflections of the surrounding fauna.Whilst borders are a matter of taste, you should make sure it''s symmetric - yours looks as if it had been painted by hand. 3.', '2006-04-15 15:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314388, 315954, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the fisheye distortion in your picture. The image would have been perfect if the border had jumped into the sun. 7.</td>', 'I like the fisheye distortion in your picture. The image would have been perfect if the border had jumped into the sun. 7.', '2006-04-15 15:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314390, 316765, 27845, '<td valign="top">Hm, I can''t figure out in what situation this image has been taken :) The expressions are well captured, the missing background gives your scene an interesting abstract quality. I''m a bit annoyed by the ''blur'' on the shoulders in the middle and the hair on the left. What is that? 8.</td>', 'Hm, I can''t figure out in what situation this image has been taken :) The expressions are well captured, the missing background gives your scene an interesting abstract quality. I''m a bit annoyed by the ''blur'' on the shoulders in the middle and the hair on the left. What is that? 8.', '2006-04-15 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314393, 319026, 27845, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of scalvert''s ''Hey kids, let''s have some fun'' pictures. I like the mixture of real and painted elements. The moment and the fun are well captured. The fence feels a bit too close to the background though. 9.</td>', 'This looks like one of scalvert''s ''Hey kids, let''s have some fun'' pictures. I like the mixture of real and painted elements. The moment and the fun are well captured. The fence feels a bit too close to the background though. 9.', '2006-04-15 15:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314396, 318890, 27845, '<td valign="top">Impressive lighting. The composition is well made, very dynamic. 10.</td>', 'Impressive lighting. The composition is well made, very dynamic. 10.', '2006-04-15 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314406, 315867, 27845, '<td valign="top">Tooo much DOF! This would have been so much better with a focus-isolated subject. 5.</td>', 'Tooo much DOF! This would have been so much better with a focus-isolated subject. 5.', '2006-04-15 16:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314410, 317355, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting, the exposure time was a bit too long for this kind of shot though. 8.</td>', 'Cool lighting, the exposure time was a bit too long for this kind of shot though. 8.', '2006-04-15 16:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314414, 318975, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like this unusual POV. The composition works well with it, the subdued colours are a good choice. The dodging is nice on the trousers. 10.</td>', 'I like this unusual POV. The composition works well with it, the subdued colours are a good choice. The dodging is nice on the trousers. 10.', '2006-04-15 16:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314416, 318758, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your image is too busy, the subject is lost among the background elements. 3.</td>', 'Your image is too busy, the subject is lost among the background elements. 3.', '2006-04-15 16:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314420, 318769, 27845, '<td valign="top">If you want the subject to stand out against the background, set a smaller DOF on your camera. Blurring the background in post processing usually looks clumsy and unnatural. 5.</td>', 'If you want the subject to stand out against the background, set a smaller DOF on your camera. Blurring the background in post processing usually looks clumsy and unnatural. 5.', '2006-04-15 16:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314422, 319033, 27845, '<td valign="top">The trees make your background too busy. With this kind of picture, backgrounds are something you need to pay particular attention to. It seems you used flash, which was a good choice. Nonetheless a faster exposure would have been necessary. 5.</td>', 'The trees make your background too busy. With this kind of picture, backgrounds are something you need to pay particular attention to. It seems you used flash, which was a good choice. Nonetheless a faster exposure would have been necessary. 5.', '2006-04-15 16:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314423, 318750, 27845, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challange topic. I would have appreciated this in B&amp;W, the play of light and shadow would have come over much nicer. You captured some interestin patterns here. 8.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challange topic. I would have appreciated this in B&W, the play of light and shadow would have come over much nicer. You captured some interestin patterns here. 8.', '2006-04-15 16:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314424, 318741, 27845, '<td valign="top">I tried this a lot during the shooting I did for this challenge and failed. I awe you for your precision in motion blurring. 7.</td>', 'I tried this a lot during the shooting I did for this challenge and failed. I awe you for your precision in motion blurring. 7.', '2006-04-15 16:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314426, 318798, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique. And quite brave to submit this here. The location is not that interesting though. 8.</td>', 'Interesting technique. And quite brave to submit this here. The location is not that interesting though. 8.', '2006-04-15 16:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314428, 318899, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good post processing, bad DOF. 6.</td>', 'Good post processing, bad DOF. 6.', '2006-04-15 16:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314500, 318961, 56048, '<td valign="top">this would have gotten a 6 or 7 out of me, but those boots bumped it straight to a 9.  nice job.  only thing i would have changed is to have framed the girl on the right side of the photo so she''s not jumping out of the photo.  love the photo.</td>', 'this would have gotten a 6 or 7 out of me, but those boots bumped it straight to a 9.  nice job.  only thing i would have changed is to have framed the girl on the right side of the photo so she''s not jumping out of the photo.  love the photo.', '2006-04-15 17:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314600, 318890, 3032, '<td valign="top">The diagonal angle of the horizon and pole add a lot of dynamics to this photo. Pretty slick lighting.</td>', 'The diagonal angle of the horizon and pole add a lot of dynamics to this photo. Pretty slick lighting.', '2006-04-15 19:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314602, 318661, 3032, '<td valign="top">The distance compression of a telephoto is a bit too much here. It looks a bit weird. I like the color and the way the light works (except for the highlight blowouts). 8</td>', 'The distance compression of a telephoto is a bit too much here. It looks a bit weird. I like the color and the way the light works (except for the highlight blowouts). 8', '2006-04-15 19:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314604, 318895, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool high key shot.</td>', 'Cool high key shot.', '2006-04-15 19:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314606, 318951, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great light and scene. Good in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Great light and scene. Good in b&w.', '2006-04-15 19:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314614, 318991, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and how the jumping girl breakes those. Also good gradation from shadow to highlight and matching greens of the grass and dress.</td>', 'I like the lines and how the jumping girl breakes those. Also good gradation from shadow to highlight and matching greens of the grass and dress.', '2006-04-15 19:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314620, 318905, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great angle, cool shot.</td>', 'Great angle, cool shot.', '2006-04-15 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314622, 318936, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good panning.</td>', 'Good panning.', '2006-04-15 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314776, 318579, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture.  Difficult, especially with the whites, but perhaps a tweaking of the colors, etc may have given this a bit more ''pop''.  Quality dependent, perhaps a tighter crop too, but the context/scale is also good here so who knows.</td>', '7 - Good capture.  Difficult, especially with the whites, but perhaps a tweaking of the colors, etc may have given this a bit more ''pop''.  Quality dependent, perhaps a tighter crop too, but the context/scale is also good here so who knows.', '2006-04-15 20:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314778, 318790, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good moment/concentration capture.  Simple clothing helps.  Perhaps a variation in cropping may have given this a little extra, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good moment/concentration capture.  Simple clothing helps.  Perhaps a variation in cropping may have given this a little extra, in my opinion.', '2006-04-15 20:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314780, 318578, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture.  Wish the ball was in the picture too for added context/story.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop &amp; nudge rotate (if you had the room) may have also given this a bit more of an edge.</td>', '7 - Good capture.  Wish the ball was in the picture too for added context/story.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop & nudge rotate (if you had the room) may have also given this a bit more of an edge.', '2006-04-15 20:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314783, 318893, 49948, '<td valign="top">creativity-10</td>', 'creativity-10', '2006-04-15 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314784, 318139, 49948, '<td valign="top">the color,i love it</td>', 'the color,i love it', '2006-04-15 20:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314785, 318991, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice composition and balance and capture.  Difficult to adjust the colors/contrast I imagine, as already looks a little ''blown'' in some areas, but could just be lack of grass &amp;/or a processing effect (apologies in advance if wrong).  Not sure on the frame, mostly for the fact I''d rather see the extra pixels of the shot itself.  Also not sure, but perhaps a more finely tuned crop may have given this a little extra, but your call, obviously.</td>', '7 - Nice composition and balance and capture.  Difficult to adjust the colors/contrast I imagine, as already looks a little ''blown'' in some areas, but could just be lack of grass &/or a processing effect (apologies in advance if wrong).  Not sure on the frame, mostly for the fact I''d rather see the extra pixels of the shot itself.  Also not sure, but perhaps a more finely tuned crop may have given this a little extra, but your call, obviously.', '2006-04-15 20:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314787, 318895, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - A good capture, both the action and expression.  Just the ''battle'' with the contrast, which you''re likely well aware.  Perhaps the b&amp;w helped with this, who knows.  A fraction nudge rotation to get this ''straighter'' (if you were able to with what you had, of course - and doesn''t look you had it, with where you''ve got the hair at the top) would have also made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - A good capture, both the action and expression.  Just the ''battle'' with the contrast, which you''re likely well aware.  Perhaps the b&w helped with this, who knows.  A fraction nudge rotation to get this ''straighter'' (if you were able to with what you had, of course - and doesn''t look you had it, with where you''ve got the hair at the top) would have also made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-15 20:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314788, 318810, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Wish it were bigger, 640 width at least, or height, depending what you had to work with, including quality, of course.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Wish it were bigger, 640 width at least, or height, depending what you had to work with, including quality, of course.', '2006-04-15 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314790, 318862, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Like the simplicity.  Difficult, but perhaps a nudge rotation up on the left, although not sure as this angle does add to the ''drama''.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Like the simplicity.  Difficult, but perhaps a nudge rotation up on the left, although not sure as this angle does add to the ''drama''.  Not sure on the frame.', '2006-04-15 20:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314820, 317329, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good.  Like the simplicity.  Whilst the power/electicity lines/cables detract slightly, they also add something here in my opinion.  Tweaking of the colors (as I''m guessing this is not natural), works well here.  Good sharp perspective and use of silhouette(s).  Perhaps just a little more height may have made this even better, not sure.  More definition/''cleaner'' in the silhouette of the ''dunker'' too, but difficult.</td>', '8 - Good.  Like the simplicity.  Whilst the power/electicity lines/cables detract slightly, they also add something here in my opinion.  Tweaking of the colors (as I''m guessing this is not natural), works well here.  Good sharp perspective and use of silhouette(s).  Perhaps just a little more height may have made this even better, not sure.  More definition/''cleaner'' in the silhouette of the ''dunker'' too, but difficult.', '2006-04-15 21:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314821, 315954, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Lens works well here.  Nudge rotation up on the left to get it more balanced make this even better in my opinion.  Depending what was there/you had to work with, perhaps even a little more width either side, who knows.  Good control of the lighting/sunlight/etc to retain detail in the ''boarder''.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Lens works well here.  Nudge rotation up on the left to get it more balanced make this even better in my opinion.  Depending what was there/you had to work with, perhaps even a little more width either side, who knows.  Good control of the lighting/sunlight/etc to retain detail in the ''boarder''.', '2006-04-15 21:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314825, 318759, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Up from 7.  Like this, including the effects which I think work quite well here.  Main thing is the ''person'' on the right, so a different cropping would have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a little tweaking of the brightness/lighting, just to lift it a fraction, but minor.  Like the clouds.</td>', '8 - Up from 7.  Like this, including the effects which I think work quite well here.  Main thing is the ''person'' on the right, so a different cropping would have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a little tweaking of the brightness/lighting, just to lift it a fraction, but minor.  Like the clouds.', '2006-04-15 21:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314827, 318611, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture.  Like the ''shine'' on the ski.  Difficult, but perhaps a more finely tuned crop, not sure.  Maybe even b&amp;w/toning may have given this extra, who knows - your call anyway, obviously.</td>', '7 - Good capture.  Like the ''shine'' on the ski.  Difficult, but perhaps a more finely tuned crop, not sure.  Maybe even b&w/toning may have given this extra, who knows - your call anyway, obviously.', '2006-04-15 21:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314831, 318804, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good capture and pose.  ''Somehow'' just a tweaking of the colors or maybe composition <i>(not sure, good as is - just needs something to ''lift'' it)</i>, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Very good capture and pose.  ''Somehow'' just a tweaking of the colors or maybe composition (not sure, good as is - just needs something to ''lift'' it), make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-15 21:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314833, 318670, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good perspective and composition.  Not much to be done about it, but the harness ''seat'' just ''removes'' a certain sense of ''daring'' - if that makes sense.  A slight tweaking of the colors may have given this a little more ''pop'' and a little extra in my opinion - although likely difficult with the blues together.</td>', '8 - Good perspective and composition.  Not much to be done about it, but the harness ''seat'' just ''removes'' a certain sense of ''daring'' - if that makes sense.  A slight tweaking of the colors may have given this a little more ''pop'' and a little extra in my opinion - although likely difficult with the blues together.', '2006-04-15 21:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314837, 318661, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Processing/toning works well here in my opinion.  Difficult, but perhaps a fraction more ''lightness'' (for more ''pop'') and a more finely tuned crop, especially at the top, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Processing/toning works well here in my opinion.  Difficult, but perhaps a fraction more ''lightness'' (for more ''pop'') and a more finely tuned crop, especially at the top, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-15 21:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314839, 318912, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Balance/symmetry very good.  Difficult shot, likely lens/camera dependent etc, but ''if only'' even more ''stop motion'' and clarity ... but difficult, and no idea how <i>(just know I''ve seen some amazing shots of gymnasts)</i>.  Tweaking of the colors, especially to try to alter the background to ''lift'' this even more, <i>may</i> have also given this a bit more ''pop''.  <i>Hope you understand what I''m trying to say here: a very difficult to shot to ''nail''.</i></td>', '8 - Very good.  Balance/symmetry very good.  Difficult shot, likely lens/camera dependent etc, but ''if only'' even more ''stop motion'' and clarity ... but difficult, and no idea how (just know I''ve seen some amazing shots of gymnasts).  Tweaking of the colors, especially to try to alter the background to ''lift'' this even more, may have also given this a bit more ''pop''.  Hope you understand what I''m trying to say here: a very difficult to shot to ''nail''.', '2006-04-15 21:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314843, 318890, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent shot.  Colors and tonings (effects?) work very well here.  Lighting makes the drama too.  Perhaps the only thing would be bottom left darker area and the slightly blown(?)/something/loss of detail in areas on the face, but difficult.  Like the rotate/angle.  Power lines definitely add in this shot, in my opinion.</td>', '9 - Excellent shot.  Colors and tonings (effects?) work very well here.  Lighting makes the drama too.  Perhaps the only thing would be bottom left darker area and the slightly blown(?)/something/loss of detail in areas on the face, but difficult.  Like the rotate/angle.  Power lines definitely add in this shot, in my opinion.', '2006-04-15 21:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2314878, 318950, 49948, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2006-04-15 21:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
