(2316514, 318386, 18197, '<td valign="top">I originally commented: "dnmc." Upon reflection what I see as black shiloutes I suppose could be knees of the soles of shoes. And maybe the little shiloute humps to the right could be fingers. So maybe there is a loose connection to the challenge, but it''s hanging from a thread.</td>', 'I originally commented: "dnmc." Upon reflection what I see as black shiloutes I suppose could be knees of the soles of shoes. And maybe the little shiloute humps to the right could be fingers. So maybe there is a loose connection to the challenge, but it''s hanging from a thread.', '2006-04-16 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
