(2316590, 318771, 53572, '<td valign="top">a great idea, but the composition and focus realy let you down.  if this was cropped close on the figures, it wuold be much more striking.</td>', 'a great idea, but the composition and focus realy let you down.  if this was cropped close on the figures, it wuold be much more striking.', '2006-04-16 19:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316591, 318845, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice image, great shot. however, the branches in the foreground are very distracting.  perhaps if you burned them a bit, they might not be so dominant?</td>', 'a nice image, great shot. however, the branches in the foreground are very distracting.  perhaps if you burned them a bit, they might not be so dominant?', '2006-04-16 19:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316593, 317632, 53572, '<td valign="top">it''s a nice image, but i think it would be improved if shot from a different angle (yeah, i know it wouldn''t be the same image then, but...)  the pips in teh left background are a bit distracting, and the arch on the jumpers back could make a lovely shape, which we don''t see form this angle.  also, teh busy-ness of the landing pad (?) at the bottom is distracting.</td>', 'it''s a nice image, but i think it would be improved if shot from a different angle (yeah, i know it wouldn''t be the same image then, but...)  the pips in teh left background are a bit distracting, and the arch on the jumpers back could make a lovely shape, which we don''t see form this angle.  also, teh busy-ness of the landing pad (?) at the bottom is distracting.', '2006-04-16 19:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316596, 317953, 53572, '<td valign="top">a great start, but the focus is a bit weak, and i wish the goose''s beak was all in the shot.</td>', 'a great start, but the focus is a bit weak, and i wish the goose''s beak was all in the shot.', '2006-04-16 19:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316598, 318755, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice image.  just a few little things hold it back.  the ramp (?) at the bottom is distracting with the grafitti etc.  shooting from a lower angle might have left it out of the shot, as well as giving a bit more drama.  the sky is a little blown out too - the clouds , especially in the bottom left, are really very very white, and overpower the cyclist.</td>', 'a nice image.  just a few little things hold it back.  the ramp (?) at the bottom is distracting with the grafitti etc.  shooting from a lower angle might have left it out of the shot, as well as giving a bit more drama.  the sky is a little blown out too - the clouds , especially in the bottom left, are really very very white, and overpower the cyclist.', '2006-04-16 19:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316601, 319033, 53572, '<td valign="top">a ggod snap, but if it was cropped much tighter, to get rid of hte ramp and the onlooker, it would be a much better shot.</td>', 'a ggod snap, but if it was cropped much tighter, to get rid of hte ramp and the onlooker, it would be a much better shot.', '2006-04-16 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316606, 318992, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice snap, but the harsh flash light brings it down.  if you had darkened the backround, to get rid of the harsh shadows and increased emphasis on the dog and pole, it would really improve the shot.  also, a bit of burning on the right side of the pose would help.</td>', 'a nice snap, but the harsh flash light brings it down.  if you had darkened the backround, to get rid of the harsh shadows and increased emphasis on the dog and pole, it would really improve the shot.  also, a bit of burning on the right side of the pose would help.', '2006-04-16 19:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
