(2316715, 319026, 25397, '<td valign="top">scalvert?<br/>nice and pretty as usual, just seems a tad flat to me.<br/> <br/>a suggestion PS-wise for this image:<br/> <br/>If you have CS or higher, adjust the levels in the ''Find dark and Light Colors'' algorithm. You can do this by going into the levels menu, then hitting options, selecting ''Find dark and Light Colors.''<br/>You will notice a big change immediataly in the tones without even sliding the bars.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps<br/> <br/>-JL</td>', 'scalvert?nice and pretty as usual, just seems a tad flat to me. a suggestion PS-wise for this image: If you have CS or higher, adjust the levels in the ''Find dark and Light Colors'' algorithm. You can do this by going into the levels menu, then hitting options, selecting ''Find dark and Light Colors.''You will notice a big change immediataly in the tones without even sliding the bars. Hope this helps -JL', '2006-04-16 21:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
