(2317358, 319026, 18367, '<td valign="top">I truly must need a great deal more exposure to what is considered a  good photo in this site, as I had scored this a 9.<br/> <br/>While I do appreciate the fact that we all have different methods of scoring, I honestly cannot even begin to comprehend how a photo like this one would warrant a score of less than 5, much less the 1 to 3 scores.<br/> <br/>Great photo, regardless of what the voting public has decided.<br/> <br/>Ray<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-17 01:12:59.</i></td>', 'I truly must need a great deal more exposure to what is considered a  good photo in this site, as I had scored this a 9. While I do appreciate the fact that we all have different methods of scoring, I honestly cannot even begin to comprehend how a photo like this one would warrant a score of less than 5, much less the 1 to 3 scores. Great photo, regardless of what the voting public has decided. Ray', '2006-04-17 01:35:40.000000', '2006-04-17 02:12:59.000000', 0),
