(2317395, 318578, 36470, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  I am excited for you!  Excellent sports shot :)</td>', 'Congrats!  I am excited for you!  Excellent sports shot :)', '2006-04-17 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2317396, 318101, 34938, '<td valign="top">I wish you didn''t enter this in this challenge. It''s such a great shot of such a beautiful girl and now it finished in the bottom few shots, which is sad. Sometimes you have to really think about NOT entering a shot. I do love this photo and I hope you put it in your portfolio front page.</td>', 'I wish you didn''t enter this in this challenge. It''s such a great shot of such a beautiful girl and now it finished in the bottom few shots, which is sad. Sometimes you have to really think about NOT entering a shot. I do love this photo and I hope you put it in your portfolio front page.', '2006-04-17 01:45:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2317404, 315954, 25952, '<td valign="top">that russian lens was probably the zenitar which has good and bad copies out, but mostly its not too hot, but who cares about pixel peeping when u got the shot.<br/> <br/>Only thing that would make this better is a powerful fill flash and an underexposed sky, but its still pretty solid, congrats man.</td>', 'that russian lens was probably the zenitar which has good and bad copies out, but mostly its not too hot, but who cares about pixel peeping when u got the shot. Only thing that would make this better is a powerful fill flash and an underexposed sky, but its still pretty solid, congrats man.', '2006-04-17 01:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2317406, 318377, 18367, '<td valign="top">I honestly thought this would have done much better.  The mere fact that you managed to capture this event was a bonus in my opinion.  I truly did like this photo, and had it been just a tad crisper I would have scored it a 10.<br/> <br/>Good job and keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'I honestly thought this would have done much better.  The mere fact that you managed to capture this event was a bonus in my opinion.  I truly did like this photo, and had it been just a tad crisper I would have scored it a 10. Good job and keep up the good work. Ray', '2006-04-17 01:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
