(2317768, 318390, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fantastic entry, Deannda! I love the processing here; the subject is ready to jump out of the screen. The background is so interesting with this processing ... looks so old-timey. The graffiti also adds interest. But the best part is the gradient or whatever it is you put around the edges, especially in the sky area. I think that''s what makes the biker stand out so well.</td>', 'Fantastic entry, Deannda! I love the processing here; the subject is ready to jump out of the screen. The background is so interesting with this processing ... looks so old-timey. The graffiti also adds interest. But the best part is the gradient or whatever it is you put around the edges, especially in the sky area. I think that''s what makes the biker stand out so well.', '2006-04-17 03:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
