(2317900, 316638, 54392, '<td valign="top">I''m really disappointed with this result...I think it''s a great shot and one of the best in my portfolio, but apparently thinking out of the box is not appreciated here or people simply misunderstood. Thanks to the people who did understand and appreciated the shot with a good score though! :)</td>', 'I''m really disappointed with this result...I think it''s a great shot and one of the best in my portfolio, but apparently thinking out of the box is not appreciated here or people simply misunderstood. Thanks to the people who did understand and appreciated the shot with a good score though! :)', '2006-04-17 05:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2317932, 318701, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this did so poorly; it doesn''t deserve so many 1s and 2s. It''s a kind of shot that you would see in some electrical store''s advertising brochure (or junk mail...). Creative, but flawed (the shadow, as mentioned).</td>', 'I''m surprised this did so poorly; it doesn''t deserve so many 1s and 2s. It''s a kind of shot that you would see in some electrical store''s advertising brochure (or junk mail...). Creative, but flawed (the shadow, as mentioned).', '2006-04-17 05:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
