(2318027, 318992, 50551, '<td valign="top">A strong composition with very sharp relief of the subject. Good detail on the dog but overall the background seems to get in the way of the picture itself. Maybe a flash diffuser would have helped here and blurring some of the background to make the dog realy stand out?</td>', 'A strong composition with very sharp relief of the subject. Good detail on the dog but overall the background seems to get in the way of the picture itself. Maybe a flash diffuser would have helped here and blurring some of the background to make the dog realy stand out?', '2006-04-17 06:43:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318030, 318792, 50551, '<td valign="top">A really good shot compositionally and in terms of the lines and flow of the picture itself. I am surprised this did not do better.</td>', 'A really good shot compositionally and in terms of the lines and flow of the picture itself. I am surprised this did not do better.', '2006-04-17 06:45:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318031, 315954, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon, well taken shot and deserved to win.  Only thing I can think of to make it better would be if you darkened the sky a little bit, not too much and made it a deep blue instead of light blue like it is now but other than that, awesome.  Love the composition.  I´ll get you next time :)</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon, well taken shot and deserved to win.  Only thing I can think of to make it better would be if you darkened the sky a little bit, not too much and made it a deep blue instead of light blue like it is now but other than that, awesome.  Love the composition.  I´ll get you next time :)', '2006-04-17 06:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318035, 318231, 50551, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo in all respects. Love the desaturation and the visual impact of the leads and the copper. Good to see an off the wall doing well.</td>', 'Excellent photo in all respects. Love the desaturation and the visual impact of the leads and the copper. Good to see an off the wall doing well.', '2006-04-17 06:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318039, 318578, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hehe, well congratulatsions to you too dude, well deserving of a ribbon and if there had been a ball in this picture, I think you would have beat bot of us and taken this challenge, awesome moment you captured there and love the expressions of the players.<br/> <br/>From the guy next to you on the winners podium! :)</td>', 'Hehe, well congratulatsions to you too dude, well deserving of a ribbon and if there had been a ball in this picture, I think you would have beat bot of us and taken this challenge, awesome moment you captured there and love the expressions of the players. From the guy next to you on the winners podium! :)', '2006-04-17 06:47:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318055, 318212, 13879, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!<br/>YEAH almost made it, could just feel in my bones I was due for another ribbon!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-17 05:58:03.</i></td>', 'LOL!!!YEAH almost made it, could just feel in my bones I was due for another ribbon!', '2006-04-17 06:57:07.000000', '2006-04-17 06:58:03.000000', 0),
