(2318731, 318792, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot. The flare and shadows worked really well. Good lines and color. I am glad that the guy in the background wasnt further out or else you may have cropped him out. He adds a nice touch to the shot. I also like that the board is not flying but just the guy with his feet off the board. Good capture.</td>', 'I really liked this shot. The flare and shadows worked really well. Good lines and color. I am glad that the guy in the background wasnt further out or else you may have cropped him out. He adds a nice touch to the shot. I also like that the board is not flying but just the guy with his feet off the board. Good capture.', '2006-04-17 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
