(2318748, 318701, 43148, '<td valign="top">Eye candy is definitly an advantage, and this does NOT have that! LOL Sorry Carl, but firstly, the image does NOT convey any "Jump" to most voters, as someone once figured out most voters spend like 10 seconds to look at the picture TOPS, so you need a hook to start with!<br/> <br/>I really think it is a creative idea, and that unto itself is a great thing - to me and a few others, anyway!! LOL<br/> <br/>Will not start on the technical flaws, as with ours, they are well known!! LOL<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Eye candy is definitly an advantage, and this does NOT have that! LOL Sorry Carl, but firstly, the image does NOT convey any "Jump" to most voters, as someone once figured out most voters spend like 10 seconds to look at the picture TOPS, so you need a hook to start with! I really think it is a creative idea, and that unto itself is a great thing - to me and a few others, anyway!! LOL Will not start on the technical flaws, as with ours, they are well known!! LOL Jacque', '2006-04-17 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
