(2319154, 318958, 47933, '<td valign="top">Very creatively cool Erick. Good stuff!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Phil I did try a swing set but it was much to hard for my girl. The hardest thing about this shot was the location so I finaly found a park that had a jogging track with work out stations. She is sitting on parallel bars at one of those stations and pulling her feet up! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Very creatively cool Erick. Good stuff! Originally posted by thegrandwazoo: Phil I did try a swing set but it was much to hard for my girl. The hardest thing about this shot was the location so I finaly found a park that had a jogging track with work out stations. She is sitting on parallel bars at one of those stations and pulling her feet up! ', '2006-04-17 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2319266, 318928, 37961, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe the placement on this!! I was one of your two 10s. I thought this stood out from all the rest. It is so interesting to look at, so much going on. Just goes to show you winning must be about luck rather than skill, because this was just fantastic. But again, art is subjective.</td>', 'I cannot believe the placement on this!! I was one of your two 10s. I thought this stood out from all the rest. It is so interesting to look at, so much going on. Just goes to show you winning must be about luck rather than skill, because this was just fantastic. But again, art is subjective.', '2006-04-17 14:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2319268, 318578, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is simply awesome action frozen in time!  Congratulations on the first of many ribbons!  It just had to happen.</td>', 'This is simply awesome action frozen in time!  Congratulations on the first of many ribbons!  It just had to happen.', '2006-04-17 14:45:54.000000', NULL, 0),
