(2319542, 318950, 40667, '<td valign="top">Haha, Awsome!! Omg, yeah, i guess your a bit outa your comfort zone eh? lol, It''s good live risky once and a while ;-) WHAT?!! no indepth description, lol? Hey! look on the bright side!!! you switched a frog for a frog on ur front page ;-)<br/>Really like it tho Anna, Nice Job!</td>', 'Haha, Awsome!! Omg, yeah, i guess your a bit outa your comfort zone eh? lol, It''s good live risky once and a while ;-) WHAT?!! no indepth description, lol? Hey! look on the bright side!!! you switched a frog for a frog on ur front page ;-)Really like it tho Anna, Nice Job!', '2006-04-17 16:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2319561, 317801, 48890, '<td valign="top">I gave this pictuere a 9.  I like the real-life flavour that it has.  It captures a nice moment, and doesn''t have that commercial plastic look that the voters here prefer.  When I voted for it, I knew that it was not going to do well here: this picture was too good for DPC.<br/> <br/>I''m a bit disappointed that you yourself are calling this picture boring.  I *don''t* think that this photo is boring; in fact, it''s amoung top 10 I voted for this challenge.</td>', 'I gave this pictuere a 9.  I like the real-life flavour that it has.  It captures a nice moment, and doesn''t have that commercial plastic look that the voters here prefer.  When I voted for it, I knew that it was not going to do well here: this picture was too good for DPC. I''m a bit disappointed that you yourself are calling this picture boring.  I *don''t* think that this photo is boring; in fact, it''s amoung top 10 I voted for this challenge.', '2006-04-17 16:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
