(2319627, 318994, 43148, '<td valign="top">I did NOT give this a ten!! Guarantee that!! Though I love the photographer and the subject both (not with the same intensity, obviously), it is a harsh seeming photo with blurred edges, have not a clue as to how/why anyone could vote it a 1 or 2, but...<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'I did NOT give this a ten!! Guarantee that!! Though I love the photographer and the subject both (not with the same intensity, obviously), it is a harsh seeming photo with blurred edges, have not a clue as to how/why anyone could vote it a 1 or 2, but... Jacque', '2006-04-17 16:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2319635, 318595, 43148, '<td valign="top">Hi, David, ONLY thing I see (and noticed it instantly) is the muted/faded/dirty looking colors in the parachute itself, sky is great, focus may be a TAD soft, but that is natural for this type of shot and does not bother me much at all. The colors do, hope this helps at least a little!!<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Hi, David, ONLY thing I see (and noticed it instantly) is the muted/faded/dirty looking colors in the parachute itself, sky is great, focus may be a TAD soft, but that is natural for this type of shot and does not bother me much at all. The colors do, hope this helps at least a little!! Jacque', '2006-04-17 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
