(2319662, 318831, 43148, '<td valign="top">I honestly think considering it IS a toy (obviously) your score is really not bad. As melethia commented, lots of people feel. Toys - (outside of specific challenges I E toys, playtime, children at play, etc), score low! Maybe people feel they are too easy to set up, we kmow that is not true, but....<br/> <br/>Otherwise, slightly soft on focus of car - background colors are great to me, idea and execution were very good. <br/> <br/>Hope this helps a little,<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'I honestly think considering it IS a toy (obviously) your score is really not bad. As melethia commented, lots of people feel. Toys - (outside of specific challenges I E toys, playtime, children at play, etc), score low! Maybe people feel they are too easy to set up, we kmow that is not true, but.... Otherwise, slightly soft on focus of car - background colors are great to me, idea and execution were very good.  Hope this helps a little, Jacque', '2006-04-17 16:56:41.000000', NULL, 0),
