(2319764, 318386, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Node:</b></div><hr/><i> Mmmmm not one of the comments are ticked off as helpfull?  Wonder why? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Only because I hadn''t gotten around to reading them yet -- I don''t read them during the voting period.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> This is the best, most relevant to the challenge, brown ribbon I''ve ever seen. Congratulations! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-17 16:33:00.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Node: Mmmmm not one of the comments are ticked off as helpfull?  Wonder why?  Only because I hadn''t gotten around to reading them yet -- I don''t read them during the voting period.Originally posted by posthumous: This is the best, most relevant to the challenge, brown ribbon I''ve ever seen. Congratulations!  Thanks!', '2006-04-17 17:31:45.000000', '2006-04-17 17:33:00.000000', 0),
