(2321427, 318661, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another high placement, Les.  I really like the stop action, but most of all the overall tones.  You have a gift for turning the ordinary into a really spectacular visual.</td>', 'Congrats on another high placement, Les.  I really like the stop action, but most of all the overall tones.  You have a gift for turning the ordinary into a really spectacular visual.', '2006-04-18 09:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2321700, 318950, 6519, '<td valign="top">Sandy, Beetle feels cheated because she checked Annah''s photographer''s notes after the challenge (which she has since removed!!).<br/> <br/>The frog isn''t real, it''s just a background - the hand is the only real thing. <br/> <br/>The photo looks great, it is entirely within the rules, she did a good job of it all and I''m not trying to take that away from her.<br/> <br/>I just feel let down because I gave her the benefit of the doubt that it was all real, but it wasn''t :-(</td>', 'Sandy, Beetle feels cheated because she checked Annah''s photographer''s notes after the challenge (which she has since removed!!). The frog isn''t real, it''s just a background - the hand is the only real thing.  The photo looks great, it is entirely within the rules, she did a good job of it all and I''m not trying to take that away from her. I just feel let down because I gave her the benefit of the doubt that it was all real, but it wasn''t :-(', '2006-04-18 12:16:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2321869, 317801, 46468, '<td valign="top">IMO, only- LOL, black and white seems to be a lower scoring medium than color, noticed that time and time again on dpc. That being said, nice photo, sharp, but missing that "pop" that is needed to score well above 5, does not matter to most voters the clarity of image, focus or creativity, if it does NOT have that pop factor, not going to score well!<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'IMO, only- LOL, black and white seems to be a lower scoring medium than color, noticed that time and time again on dpc. That being said, nice photo, sharp, but missing that "pop" that is needed to score well above 5, does not matter to most voters the clarity of image, focus or creativity, if it does NOT have that pop factor, not going to score well! Jacque', '2006-04-18 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 0),
