(2323929, 317089, 27164, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  This was severly underrated IMO.  Granted, the lower portion seems a bit oversharpened but this was still a gorgeous shot that deserved better - MUCH better than 10th from last.  I''m guessing a lot of users must have felt it was a stretch to meet the challenge.</td>', 'This is beautiful!  This was severly underrated IMO.  Granted, the lower portion seems a bit oversharpened but this was still a gorgeous shot that deserved better - MUCH better than 10th from last.  I''m guessing a lot of users must have felt it was a stretch to meet the challenge.', '2006-04-19 01:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
