(2327755, 318794, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5.  Thought it was a fairly good capture of a difficult shot to get.  To be honest, as with some of the other shots, I didn''t pay as much attention to the title (as I likely should have), hence didn''t ''notice'' the ''eerie reflection''.  <i>Does</i> look a little like a ''startled'' Mona Lisa.</td>', 'I gave this a 5.  Thought it was a fairly good capture of a difficult shot to get.  To be honest, as with some of the other shots, I didn''t pay as much attention to the title (as I likely should have), hence didn''t ''notice'' the ''eerie reflection''.  Does look a little like a ''startled'' Mona Lisa.', '2006-04-19 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
