(2328040, 318950, 35274, '<td valign="top">First off, I would like to greatly appoligize for this image. No, the frog isn''t real :-( I''m sorry. I didn''t mean to do the pic this way. I wanted to find a real froggy, but had no luck. Then I had the thought of cutting out this one and putting him in a different "enviroment". That didn''t go so well :-P I entered this out of a last minute desperation sort of thing. I immediately felt bad about that choice when people actually belived it was real and gave me points for it. So yeah. Sorry everyone! I won''t try anything like this again. Thank you for all the votes and comments, though I really don''t think I deserve it.</td>', 'First off, I would like to greatly appoligize for this image. No, the frog isn''t real :-( I''m sorry. I didn''t mean to do the pic this way. I wanted to find a real froggy, but had no luck. Then I had the thought of cutting out this one and putting him in a different "enviroment". That didn''t go so well :-P I entered this out of a last minute desperation sort of thing. I immediately felt bad about that choice when people actually belived it was real and gave me points for it. So yeah. Sorry everyone! I won''t try anything like this again. Thank you for all the votes and comments, though I really don''t think I deserve it.', '2006-04-20 00:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2328260, 315954, 38800, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> The shot is great and did get the blue...but...<br/> <br/>...if we don''t follow those simple rules about "the time frame" of the photo, then we could all just go into our portfolio and grab the best image to meet the current challenge.<br/> <br/>I''d rather have everyone race to get the best shot during the week!<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/>Bite me, I already said it was an honest mistake.</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: The shot is great and did get the blue...but... ...if we don''t follow those simple rules about "the time frame" of the photo, then we could all just go into our portfolio and grab the best image to meet the current challenge. I''d rather have everyone race to get the best shot during the week! Bite me, I already said it was an honest mistake.', '2006-04-20 01:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
