(2336811, 318711, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good timing. I don''t entirely agree with the negative space on the top of the frame being bad, but I would like to see more horizontal resolution.. cropping some from the top and making use of the 640px limit would have helped some, as would using a thinner border so that the players took up more of the frame.<br/>Also, the contrast seems kind of high, but it might have been partly the time of day it was shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, good timing. I don''t entirely agree with the negative space on the top of the frame being bad, but I would like to see more horizontal resolution.. cropping some from the top and making use of the 640px limit would have helped some, as would using a thinner border so that the players took up more of the frame.Also, the contrast seems kind of high, but it might have been partly the time of day it was shot.', '2006-04-23 16:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
