(2337171, 318958, 9462, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:</b></div><hr/><i>DPC MAKES YOU A BETTER PHOTOGRAPHER. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>HAHAHA, because you win a ribbon all the sudden DPC makes ppl better at photography. Sorry but DPC doesn''t "make" anyone a better phototgrapher. Education, experimentation &amp; in-depth critiques all help to aide a person in becoming more advanced in their photography but DPC doesn''t make the photographer, it''s only a place to learn techniques and get idea''s; the rest is up to you. Either you have an eye for it or you don''t. <br/> <br/>I can''t think of anything to say about the image that hasn''t already been stated.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:DPC MAKES YOU A BETTER PHOTOGRAPHER.  HAHAHA, because you win a ribbon all the sudden DPC makes ppl better at photography. Sorry but DPC doesn''t "make" anyone a better phototgrapher. Education, experimentation & in-depth critiques all help to aide a person in becoming more advanced in their photography but DPC doesn''t make the photographer, it''s only a place to learn techniques and get idea''s; the rest is up to you. Either you have an eye for it or you don''t.  I can''t think of anything to say about the image that hasn''t already been stated.', '2006-04-23 19:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2337273, 318958, 50231, '<td valign="top">Thanks Kali but I do believe that from all the things I have learned from DPC, and the people that participate, have made me a better photog. Not because I won a ribbon but because it is true for me!<br/> <br/>:-)</td>', 'Thanks Kali but I do believe that from all the things I have learned from DPC, and the people that participate, have made me a better photog. Not because I won a ribbon but because it is true for me! :-)', '2006-04-23 20:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2337860, 318319, 43434, '<td valign="top"><b><i>::: Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/> <br/>This is great .. shows true energy and zest!<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>I like how you have cropped for the thirds ... if not cropped excellent shooting for composition.  Background is hugely important and for this you have done well.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>More than meets the challenge.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>I always love natural light as the basis and then fiddling .. which it seems if what you have done.  The picture looks like it may be slightly oversharpened (I think I saw artifacts around the hands and hair) ... but that is minor.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>Personally I think you did well .. no 1s or 2s ... but the need to create more immediate impact may be the issue .. I thought it was great and scored it accordingly ... but looking at those who scored around you ... you did do well.<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/> <br/>Lovely cool picture .. interactive and sold to me.<br/> <br/>If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', '::: Critique Club :::  Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club. First Impression - the most important one:  This is great .. shows true energy and zest! Composition: I like how you have cropped for the thirds ... if not cropped excellent shooting for composition.  Background is hugely important and for this you have done well. Subject: More than meets the challenge. Technical (Colour and light): I always love natural light as the basis and then fiddling .. which it seems if what you have done.  The picture looks like it may be slightly oversharpened (I think I saw artifacts around the hands and hair) ... but that is minor. To grow its vote?: Personally I think you did well .. no 1s or 2s ... but the need to create more immediate impact may be the issue .. I thought it was great and scored it accordingly ... but looking at those who scored around you ... you did do well. Summary:  Lovely cool picture .. interactive and sold to me. If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system. Cheers Kari', '2006-04-24 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
