(2341359, 319021, 53147, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of hard to know whether he is going up or coming down. It may have been a bit of a stretch to think he was going to jump. Maybe catching him when he was looking out to where he would land rather than where his feet were would have had more impact - or maybe just as he was leaping. The colors seem a bit odd overall. Did he jump?<br/> <br/>Thanks for your help early on as well. Rules are tough and you helped me work through it. Thank you.</td>', 'It''s kind of hard to know whether he is going up or coming down. It may have been a bit of a stretch to think he was going to jump. Maybe catching him when he was looking out to where he would land rather than where his feet were would have had more impact - or maybe just as he was leaping. The colors seem a bit odd overall. Did he jump? Thanks for your help early on as well. Rules are tough and you helped me work through it. Thank you.', '2006-04-25 08:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
